category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libglib2.0-devel
sdesc: "Small library based on GObject that simplifies the creation and managing of child processes (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "The libgexecutor is a small library, based on GLib2 - GObject, that simplifies
the creation and managing of child processes, for programs based on
glib-GObject."
